Date: Sat, 25 Apr 2026 02:52:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Improve backtraces in Ruby 3.4 (#967)

Make them look more similar to "native" Ruby 3.4 backtraces.

Co-authored-by: Ryan Davis <ryand-ruby@zenspider.com>
(cherry picked from commit ec3ceccacfa28bdc38e267284aea91a46114bab8)
---
